1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:04,916
Running a business isn't one job. It's every
job, connected.

2
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:10,934
Meet OfficeAdmin. The business behind the work.

3
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:20,853
One place for your customers, projects,
documents, and everything that happens next.

4
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:31,191
Start with the plans. Count what matters. Turn
your takeoff into an estimate, with the
quantities still connected.

5
00:00:34,650 --> 00:00:39,434
Build the proposal. Get it approved. Turn
accepted work into an invoice.

6
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:49,159
Schedule the team. Capture time where the work
happens. Keep every hour tied to the job.

7
00:00:52,650 --> 00:00:57,786
See your costs. Track your invoices. Reconcile
the books. Know where you stand.

8
00:01:01,650 --> 00:01:05,237
And meet AIVA. An assistant with the context of
your work.

9
00:01:09,650 --> 00:01:16,559
A recorded conversation becomes more than a
transcript. See what was decided, and what needs
to happen next.

10
00:01:19,650 --> 00:01:25,495
Ask a question. Find the detail. Prepare the
follow-up. Review it. Then move it forward.

11
00:01:29,650 --> 00:01:35,292
Your projects. Your people. Your numbers.
Working together, instead of pulling you apart.

12
00:01:38,750 --> 00:01:39,836
Less chasing.

13
00:01:41,050 --> 00:01:42,049
More building.

14
00:01:45,650 --> 00:01:49,379
OfficeAdmin and AIVA. Run the work. Not the
runaround.
